title: End of the Railway Strike
new-page: true
view-if: vikzhel_strike == 1 and (coalition_government >= 1 or vikzhel_unrest < 10)
tags: event
on-arrival: {!
    Q.vikzhel_strike_ended = 1;
    Q.vikzhel_strike = 0;
    Q.workers_unrest -= 10;
    Q.railroad_strike_seen = 0; 

  	Q.military_trains = Math.max(Q.previous_military_trains + Q.military_trains, Q.previous_military_trains);
  	Q.civilian_transport = Math.max(Q.previous_civilian_transport + Q.civilian_transport, previous_civilian_transport);
  	Q.transportation_industry = Math.max(Q.previous_transportation_industry + Q.transportation_industry, Q.transportation_industry);
  	Q.industry = Math.max(Q.previous_industry + Q.industry, Q.industry);
    Q.ag_transport * 1.1; 
!}

= Railroad Strike Ends

Satisfied by our recent efforts, Vikzhel has announced that they are lifting their strike, bringing the railways back to working order. 
